      "info": {
        "name": "Simultaneous public election",
        "ability": "There are no nominations. Only living players vote on their phones for living candidates, with no null vote and no Last Breaths. At close, the Storyteller reviews ballots and totals privately, then communicates them with a synchronized roulette if somebody dies. The highest total wins with no threshold; a tie triggers a runoff and, if it remains after two rounds, nobody is expelled."
      },
