      "info": {
        "name": "Secret jury",
        "ability": "Nominations are public and only living nominees reach the ballot. A secret jury of 2, 3, 4, or 5 members depending on table size votes simultaneously on their phones before dawn. At close, the Storyteller reviews the result privately and chooses when to communicate it; identities and votes are never published. Judges must remain alive, do not use Last Breaths, and evil wins if the entire jury dies."
      },
