      "info": {
        "name": "Secret election among nominees",
        "ability": "Nominations are public and may target living or dead players. Only living players vote secretly on their phones among the nominees; null votes are allowed and there are no Last Breaths. At close, only the Storyteller sees ballots and totals and chooses when to communicate the outcome. The highest total wins with no threshold; a tie triggers a runoff and, if it remains after two rounds, everyone is spared."
      },
